noPhotos

# anti-B0 -> D_0*+ mu- anti-nu_mu (LLSW), D_0*+ -> D0 pi+ pi0 (PHSP)
# Non-resonant D(*)pipi l nu through a broad D** as in Belle II 119670000x.dec
# No B0 mixing: with VSS_BMIX, findMCDecay segfaults on the 3-body D** decay (release-08-02-05)

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B0sig  anti-B0sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
1.0  D_0*+  mu-  anti-nu_mu   LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay D_0*+
1.0  D0 pi+ pi0   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay D_0*-

End
